      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Capacity check (from \u00a76):\n  Target:       30,000 reads/sec peak\n  This design:   3,000 (app)  \u00b7  5,000 (DB)\n  \u2192 BREAKS by 6\u201310\u00d7 before we approach target.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": "6bddad36b4e449d7",
      "originalText": "Capacity check (from \u00a76):\n  Target:       30,000 reads/sec peak\n  This design:   3,000 (app)  \u00b7  5,000 (DB)\n  \u2192 BREAKS by 6\u201310\u00d7 before we approach target.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
